Review: Pelvic floor muscle training versus no treatment, or inactive control treatments, for urinary incontinence in 
women
Total studies to screen: 100

SELECTION CRITERIA:
Randomised or quasi‐randomised controlled trials in women with SUI, UUI or MUI (based on symptoms, signs or 
