│ exercise, the intervention group was followed for 1 year. MEASUREMENTS Body mass index (BMI), urine leakage, walking │
│ speed, and muscle strength were measured at baseline, after the intervention, and at follow-up. RESULTS In the       │
│ intervention group, maximum walking speed and adductor muscle strength increased significantly after the             │
